# configflux-9hi2: the product compile path (compile_model -> emit_ir) must
# emit the v2 multi-part .ccm directory alongside the CMP package, surface its
# path on ModelHandle, and bind it to the CMP model_hash (ADR-0005 §9). This
# test drives the real product API and asserts the solver constructs a
# non-empty Ccm from the emitted dir — clearing the g3f.2 load_ccm blocker.
